          "question": {
            "question": {
              "content": "A hawk uses energy to fly and hunt for its prey. To power its flight, muscle contractions, and body warmth, the hawk's body uses chemical energy. Ultimately, almost all the energy for the hawk's life processes comes from [[\u2603 dropdown 1]].",
